     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dear all,</p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Only <strong>2 seats remain</strong> for our upcoming online course: <strong>Design, Implement and Promote Species Monitoring in R</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dates: 14–16 October</p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">This course combines theory and practice of long-term monitoring protocols, covering methods such as Capture-Mark-Recapture, distance sampling, site occupancy, and N-mixture models, with hands-on examples in R.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Secure your spot here: <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" style=\"color:rgb(0,102,204);outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471481094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wgTRPey6Ee-IzcjUXhOQb\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/</a></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Best regards,</p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Carlo</p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial